    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald are pleased to introduce No. 46 The Terrace, Robswall, a beautifully presented four-bedroom family home situated within one of Malahide's most sought-after coastal developments. Combining stylish interiors with generous living accommodation, this exceptional home is perfectly designed for modern family life.\n\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, the property has been meticulously maintained and is presented in true walk in condition. With an impressive A-rated BER, the home offers outstanding energy efficiency.\n\nUpon entering, a bright and inviting hallway leads to a spacious living and dining room, where two sets of double doors fill the space with natural light and provide seamless access to the rear garden. The well-equipped kitchen features granite worktops, quality integrated appliances, and ample storage, while a utility room, guest W.C., and practical understairs storage complete the ground floor accommodation.\n\nOn the first floor there are four generously sized bedrooms, including a superb principal bedroom with en-suite bathroom, together with a modern family bathroom.\n\nExternally, the property continues to impress. A substantial driveway to the front provides excellent off-street parking and is complemented by an electric vehicle charging point. To the rear, the private landscaped garden features an attractive patio area, creating the ideal setting for outdoor dining and entertaining with in lawn area to the rear.\n\nThe location is second to none, with the scenic Coast Road, Malahide Village, and a host of excellent amenities all within easy reach. Residents can enjoy an array of renowned restaurants, cafés, boutiques, sporting facilities, and highly regarded schools, while Malahide DART Station provides convenient access to the city centre and beyond.\n\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.11m x 3.32m\nTiled floor, recessed lighting, alarm system\n\nKitchen/ Breakfast Room - 5.12m x 2.75m\nRange of Shaker style press units, tiled floor, granite worktops, whirlpool oven and hob, integrated fridge freezer and dishwasher, recessed lighting, breakfast bar counter, large double glazed window to front\n\nLiving/ Dining Room - 7.04m x 4.85m\nLarge open plan living and dining room, wooden flooring, reccess spotlights, two sets of french doors to rear garden\n\nUtility Room - 1.65m x 1.41m\nPlumbed for washing machine and dryer, storage press\n\nGuest Wc - 1.71m x 1.42m\nTiled floor and part tiled walls, wc, hand wash basin, heated towel rail, recessed lighting\n\nStorage Closet - 2.22m x 0.75\n\n\nLanding - 4.47m x 1.75m\nCarpet landing, large double glazed window, hotpress\n\nPrincipal bedroom - 4.58m x 2.95m\nDouble glazed window, built in wardrobes, carpet flooring\n\nEnsuite - 2.94m x 1.40m\nFully tiled comprising walk in shower, hand wash basin, wc and heated towel rail\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.69m x 3.34m\nBuilt in wardrobes, double glazed window, carpet flooring\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.33m x 2.27m\nDouble glazed window, carpet flooring\n\nStore - 1.43m x 0.83m\nClothes store\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.29m x 2.83m\nBuilt in wardrobes, double glazed window, carpet flooring\n\nFamily Bathroom - 2.89m x 2.00m\nFully tiled comprising bath and shower, hand wash basin, wc, heated towel rail and frosted window\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>A Rated family home </li><li>Four double bedrooms </li><li>Turnkey Condition</li><li>High Ceilings and High Quality Finish</li><li>Water softner tap</li><li>Built in wardrobes in all bedrooms</li><li>Large floored attic for storage</li><li>Sauna/ Sauna Room</li><li>Garage storage space </li><li>Electric car charger</li><li>Landscaped rear garden </li><li>UPVC Double Glazed Windows</li><li>Gas fired central heating system</li><li>Solar Panels</ul>"
